Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, gcc, make
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium

Package: pgsodium-libsodium-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: private symbol-prefixed libsodium for building pgsodium
 This package contains a PIC static libsodium 1.0.22 archive and private
 headers for pgsodium. Every defined symbol is renamed with a
 pgsodium_private_ prefix, preventing ELF interposition with the operating
 system libsodium used by other PostgreSQL extensions such as pg_vault.
